  18:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****   ==============================================================================
  19:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  20:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****   ==============================================================================
  21:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****    + This driver supports STM32N6xx devices on STM32N6570-DK (MB1939) board.
  22:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c **** 
  23:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****    + Call the function BSP_AUDIO_OUT_Init() for AUDIO OUT initialization:
  24:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****         Instance:  Select the output instance. It can only be 0 (SAI).
  25:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****         AudioInit: Audio Out structure to select the following parameters.
  26:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****                    - Device: Select the output device (headphone).
  27:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****                    - SampleRate: Select the output sample rate (8Khz .. 96Khz).
  28:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****                    - BitsPerSample: Select the output resolution (16 or 24bits per sample).
  29:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****                    - ChannelsNbr: Select the output channels number(1 for mono, 2 for stereo).
  30:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_audio.c ****                    - Volume: Select the output volume(0% .. 100%).
